.min-h-screen.bg-gradient-to-br.from-blue-50.to-indigo-100.dark:from-gray-900.dark:to-gray-800.flex.items-center.justify-center.px-4.transition-colors.duration-300
  .max-w-lg.mx-auto.text-center
    .bg-white.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded-lg.shadow-lg.p-8.transition-colors.duration-300
      h1.text-3xl.font-bold.text-gray-900.dark:text-white.mb-6 🐝 Ready to Play?
      
      .mb-6
        h2.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-200.mb-4 How to Play:
        ul.text-left.text-gray-600.dark:text-gray-300.space-y-2
          li.flex.items-start
            span.text-blue-600.dark:text-blue-400.mr-2 •
            | Read each headline carefully
          li.flex.items-start
            span.text-blue-600.dark:text-blue-400.mr-2 •
            | Decide if it's REAL or FAKE
          li.flex.items-start
            span.text-blue-600.dark:text-blue-400.mr-2 •
            | See how well you can spot the difference!
      
      .mb-6.p-4.bg-blue-50.dark:bg-blue-900/30.rounded-lg.transition-colors.duration-300
        p.text-sm.text-blue-800.dark:text-blue-300 💡 Tip: Look for overly sensational language or claims that seem too good (or bad) to be true!
      
      = form_with url: games_path, local: true, method: :post do |f|
        = f.submit "Start Game", class: "w-full bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 dark:bg-green-500 dark:hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 text-lg"
      
      .mt-4
        = link_to "← Back to Home", root_path, class: "text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-800 dark:hover:text-blue-300 text-sm"
